  "description": "XIWBAH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H94 N50 O38 Yb4 4+,3(H3 O1 1+),7(Cl1 1-),38(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2B (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.564-3.726 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.45-109.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H179Cl7N50O79Yb4.",
